---
import DiagramShell from "./DiagramShell.astro";
---

<DiagramShell
  title="Privileged review authorization flow"
  caption="Review does not change the original DENY. Any later execution requires a new request. The new request is independently evaluated. The authorization is bounded and single-use. Review itself is not permission. Reuse is denied."
  className="bg-diagram--review-auth"
>
  <div class="bg-review">
    <section class="bg-review-lane" aria-labelledby="bg-review-lane1-title">
      <h4 id="bg-review-lane1-title" class="bg-review-lane-title">ORIGINAL REQUEST</h4>
      <div class="bg-review-row" role="list">
        <div class="bg-review-card" role="listitem">Original Request</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card" role="listitem">Independent Evaluation</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--deny" role="listitem">
          <strong>ACTION DENY</strong>
          <span>REVIEW_REQUIRED</span>
        </div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--boundary" role="listitem">Original Request Finalized</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--amber" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--evidence" role="listitem">Authorization Evidence</div>
      </div>
      <p class="bg-review-lane-note">Original DENY remains final.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="bg-review-separator" role="separator">
      <p>REVIEW DOES NOT CHANGE THE ORIGINAL DENY</p>
      <p>NEW AUTHORITY APPLIES TO A NEW REQUEST</p>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-review-lane" aria-labelledby="bg-review-lane2-title">
      <h4 id="bg-review-lane2-title" class="bg-review-lane-title">SEPARATE GOVERNED REVIEW PATH</h4>
      <div class="bg-review-row bg-review-row--review" role="list">
        <div class="bg-review-card" role="listitem">Reviewer Step-Up</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--bounded" role="listitem">Bounded Single-Use Authorization</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card" role="listitem">New Application Request</div>
        <span class="bg-review-arrow bg-review-arrow--blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--decision" role="listitem">Independent Evaluation</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-review-fork" aria-label="Mutually exclusive outcomes for the new request evaluation">
        <p class="bg-review-fork-caption">Mutually exclusive outcomes</p>
        <div class="bg-review-fork-arms">
          <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--allow" role="group" aria-label="ACTION ALLOW">
            <strong>ACTION ALLOW</strong>
            <span>One-time authority consumed</span>
            <span class="bg-review-reuse">Reuse attempt → DENY</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-review-card bg-review-card--deny" role="group" aria-label="ACTION DENY">
            <strong>ACTION DENY</strong>
            <span>No execution; bounded authorization cannot be reused</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="bg-review-lane-note">Review itself is not permission.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div slot="text">
    <p>
      Phase 1: Original Request → Independent Evaluation → DENY with
      REVIEW_REQUIRED → Original Request Finalized → Authorization Evidence.
      The original DENY is final; review does not convert it to ALLOW or resume
      the original request.
    </p>
    <p>
      Phase 2: Reviewer Step-Up → Bounded Single-Use Authorization → New
      Application Request → Independent Evaluation of New Request → mutually
      exclusive fork. Branch ALLOW → new request permitted for this evaluation
      only; bounded authorization is consumed; reuse attempt is DENIED. Branch
      DENY → new request blocked; no execution; the bounded authorization cannot
      be reused.
    </p>
    <p>
      Single-use authorization is no longer reusable after the new evaluation
      attempt. Review itself is not permission.
    </p>
  </div>
</DiagramShell>

<style>
  .bg-review {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .bg-review-lane {
    border: 1px solid #3e5678;
    border-radius: 0.7rem;
    background: #0e1420;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bg-review-lane-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
    color: #a3b8d1;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bg-review-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.15fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bg-review-row--review {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.15fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .bg-review-card {
    border: 1px solid #3e5678;
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: #121b29;
    color: #edf5ff;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.28rem;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bg-review-card strong {
    color: #edf5ff;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .bg-review-card span {
    color: #a3b8d1;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .bg-review-card--deny {
    border-color: rgba(245, 92, 97, 0.55);
    border-left: 3px solid #f55c61;
  }

  .bg-review-card--deny strong {
    color: #f55c61;
  }

  .bg-review-card--allow {
    border-color: rgba(56, 199, 140, 0.5);
    border-left: 3px solid #38c78c;
  }

  .bg-review-card--allow strong {
    color: #38c78c;
  }

  .bg-review-card--evidence,
  .bg-review-card--bounded {
    border-left: 3px solid #f2ab40;
  }

  .bg-review-card--boundary,
  .bg-review-card--decision {
    border-left: 3px solid #2eabed;
  }

  .bg-review-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .bg-review-arrow--blue { color: #2eabed; }
  .bg-review-arrow--amber { color: #f2ab40; }

  .bg-review-lane-note {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    color: #a3b8d1;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bg-review-separator {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(46, 171, 237, 0.45);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: rgba(18, 27, 41, 0.72);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bg-review-separator p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #edf5ff;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bg-review-separator p + p {
    margin-top: 0.28rem;
    color: #a3b8d1;
  }

  .bg-review-fork {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .bg-review-fork-caption {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: #a3b8d1;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bg-review-fork-arms {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .bg-review-reuse {
    color: #f55c61 !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bg-review-row,
    .bg-review-row--review {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .bg-review-card {
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 0.45rem);
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: calc(50% - 0.23rem);
    }

    .bg-review-arrow {
      display: none;
    }

    .bg-review-fork-arms {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
